      "key": "exp-expand-4x-plus-5",
      "band": 2,
      "archetype": "A",
      "answerType": "SINGLE_CHOICE",
      "prompt": "A drink costs (x + 5) pence. Four drinks cost 4(x + 5) pence. Expand 4(x + 5).",
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "4x + 20",
          "correct": true
        },
        {
          "text": "4x + 5",
          "correct": false,
          "catches": "EXP-FIRST-TERM-ONLY"
        },
        {
          "text": "4x + 9",
          "correct": false,
          "catches": "EXP-FIRST-TERM-ONLY"
        },
        {
          "text": "x + 20",
          "correct": false,
          "catches": "EXP-FIRST-TERM-ONLY"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The 4 multiplies every term inside the bracket: 4 × x = 4x and 4 × 5 = 20, so 4(x + 5) = 4x + 20. Multiplying only the x by 4 gives 4x + 5, and adding 4 + 5 gives 4x + 9. Every term inside gets multiplied."
    },
    {
